# 12 · news-away — the shells keep going. Beat 22, 2.2 s.
# Staging: work left behind before this runs (a failed test, one still
# running, a hands request waiting). `news` takes unix seconds: the
# moment you walked away.
hover 5 5
home
settle
record news-away 2.2
at 0.000 news 1758300000
at 0.789 key down
quit
